SMRITI
Structured Memory Residue Inspection and Thermal Intelligence

Copyright (c) 2026 Prasad Purnaye

This product includes software developed by Prasad Purnaye.

SMRITI is a forensic memory analysis and visualization toolkit for
ELF-based RAM dump inspection, entropy heatmap generation, and volatile
artifact analysis.

The names “SMRITI” and “Structured Memory Residue Inspection and Thermal
Intelligence” are used to identify the original project. Use of these names
does not imply endorsement, certification, or approval by the author.

